WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.955
Now try it.

2
00:00:01.955 --> 00:00:04.038
Ask for something small.

3
00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:07.251
In Chat, ask a short question.

4
00:00:07.251 --> 00:00:12.193
For example: explain what a Lightning invoice is, in two sentences.

5
00:00:13.193 --> 00:00:17.737
In the app's Code view, open a project, and ask it to explain a file.

6
00:00:18.737 --> 00:00:21.660
Or create a bot, with a small daily budget.

7
00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:27.363
Every reply ends with where it ran, on your machine or the network.

8
00:00:27.363 --> 00:00:28.557
And what it cost.

9
00:00:29.557 --> 00:00:31.669
Ask in Chat opens a new chat.

10
00:00:32.669 --> 00:00:35.463
When your first task finishes, this checks off.

11
00:00:36.463 --> 00:00:37.722
Then press Next.
